      </line>
      <shape width="864" height="20" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="74" type="text" id="bXU">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(122, 116, 106, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>溶解有机碳（DOC）是水质与河陆碳循环的关键指标，但现有观测网络远不足以支撑全流域理解</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="280" height="52" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="112" type="text" id="bXE">
        <content textType="headline" fontSize="42" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>11,948</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="286" height="40" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="168" type="text" id="bXf">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(70, 64, 56, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
          <p>全流域至少有过 1 次</p>
          <p>溶解有机碳的站点总数</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bXN" startX="48" startY="224" endX="330.0017730440715" endY="224">
        <border color="rgba(216, 209, 192, 1)" width="1" />
