      <shape width="286" height="40" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="420" type="text" id="bXB">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(70, 64, 56, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
          <p>把每个站的每个月算作一格，</p>
          <p>真正有观测的格子比例</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bXZ" startX="368" startY="108" endX="368.00000000000006" endY="472.0013736237817">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="400" height="26" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="108" type="text" id="bXL">
        <content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>传统路径的三条局限</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="512" height="66" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="146" type="text" id="bXT">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)">站点均值 / 地理距离插值（克里金）</span></strong>　只看空间上离得近不近，忽略河网连通与水流方向，推不到没监测的地方</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="512" height="66" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="214" type="text" id="bXh">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)">只看单站特征的模型（随机森林等）</span></strong>　把每个站点当成互不相干的点，用不上上下游之间的因果关系</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="512" height="66" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="282" type="text" id="bXM">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)">普通图神经网络</span></strong>　把上下游一视同仁地平均，与河水只往下游流的物理过程不符</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bXi" startX="400" startY="366" endX="912.0009765615687" endY="366">
        <border color="rgba(216, 209, 192, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="512" height="24" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="380" type="text" id="bXq">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(122, 116, 106, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>核心矛盾</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="512" height="58" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="408" type="text" id="bXG">
        <content fontSize="15.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
          <p>观测高度稀疏，而河网本身携带被忽略的强结构先验——</p>
          <p>问题是如何把这一先验变成可学习、可检验的模型。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bXS" startX="48" startY="508" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="508">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="520" height="16" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bXW">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>数据来源：美国地质调查局公开监测目录（1972–2026 年）</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="112" height="16" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bXv">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" textAlign="right" wrap="false">
          <p>03 / 18</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bXx">
      <content>
        <p>先看问题的量级：流域内近一万两千个站点测过溶解有机碳，但真正有可用序列的只有约 570 个，时空格子的观测覆盖率只有 8.9%。</p>
        <p>三类传统方法各有盲区：地理插值忽略河网，单站模型忽略站点间的因果，普通图网络又把河流当成不分方向的、丢掉了流向。</p>
        <p>所以核心矛盾是：数据虽然稀疏，但河网结构本身是一份免费的强先验，本研究要回答它到底能帮我们补回多少信息。</p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  